# Release identity — copy to scripts/release.conf (gitignored) and fill in.
# Without this file, builds are ad-hoc signed and notarization is skipped:
# fine for local use, Gatekeeper will warn on other Macs.

# Developer ID Application certificate, exactly as `security find-identity -p
# codesigning -v` prints it:
#SIGNING_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID1234)"

# Keychain profile for notarytool. One-time setup:
#   xcrun notarytool store-credentials phantom-notarize \
#       --apple-id <apple-id> --team-id <team-id>
#NOTARIZE_PROFILE="phantom-notarize"

# Optional self-healing: when the keychain profile becomes inaccessible
# (data-protection keychain locks after sleep/iCloud events), build-dmg.sh
# re-provisions it non-interactively if these are exported in the
# environment (do NOT put the password in this file):
#   APPLE_ID, APPLE_TEAM_ID, APPLE_APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD

# --- Build server (docs/build-server.md) --------------------------------
# A headless job cannot open the data-protection keychain, so the build
# server notarizes with an App Store Connect API key instead of a profile
# (all three or none; a partial set is a hard error — scripts/lib/notary.sh):
#NOTARY_KEY_PATH="/Users/builder/.config/phantom-build/AuthKey.p8"
#NOTARY_KEY_ID="XXXXXXXXXX"
#NOTARY_ISSUER_ID="11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555"
# The keychain FILE holding the Developer ID (unlocked by
# scripts/build-server/unlock-build-keychain.sh before the job signs):
#SIGNING_KEYCHAIN="/Users/builder/Library/Keychains/phantom-build.keychain-db"
# The Sparkle EdDSA private key as a file (generate_keys -x), for
# publish-release.sh's generate_appcast --ed-key-file. NEVER regenerate it.
#SPARKLE_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE="/Users/builder/.config/phantom-build/sparkle_private_key"
# The scripts read this file from PHANTOM_RELEASE_CONF when set, so the
# build server keeps it outside the checkout; import-signing-material.sh
# writes it.

# Website deploy target for publish.sh (see website/infra/README.md):
#WEBSITE_BUCKET=""
#WEBSITE_DISTRIBUTION_ID=""
